Flower Fingers was added in '''Beta 39.0''' as a 5G 4/5 [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Plant Plant] with the Magic ability to deal 1 DMG to a target of your choice for each other Plant on your board. '''Beta 46.0''' gave it -1 HP, but its Magic now includes itself, allowing you to always deal at least 1 DMG.

=== Stats ===
ATK: 4

HP:
* 5 (Post Beta 39.0)
* 4 (Post Beta 46.0, Current)
Cost: 5

Abilities:
* Magic: Deal 1 DMG for each other ally Plant. (Post Beta 39.0)
* Magic: Deal 1 DMG for each ally Plant. (Post Beta 46.0, Current)
Rarity: Blue (Rare)
